url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachHis/305e1656-360b-4f28-b00d-fd6b152723b5.pdf"},{"year":2024,"url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachHis/c7330ad5-ba82-4673-baaa-b39af9c47c87.pdf"},{"year":2023,"url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachHis/58357a1d-01e7-410e-a079-834f7aefce44.pdf"}],"concalls":[]},"as_of":"2026-11-15T18:55:01+05:30","research":{"summary":"Trent Ltd is a Tata-group retailer operating fashion & lifestyle brands (Westside, Zudio, Samoh, Burnt Toast) plus food & grocery (Star, via 50:50 JV with Tesco), with 1,286 stores across 321 cities. FY26 standalone total income grew 18% to ₹20,075.87 Cr with PAT of ₹1,967.82 Cr, though like-for-like growth was low single digits and Star/THPL remains loss-making.","how_it_makes_money":"Revenue comes mainly from fashion & lifestyle retail through Westside (300 stores) and Zudio (963 stores) selling exclusive in-house brands, plus Star food & grocery (84 stores, THPL total income ₹2,773.55 Cr) and 20% stakes in Zara/Massimo Dutti India JVs.","bull":[{"point":"Strong revenue growth and margin expansion","quote":"The Company has reported total income of ` 20,075.87 Crore (` 16,997.48 Crore in FY25), a growth of 18%","page":127,"url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachHis/c3f6fa4a-3c51-453e-b634-3c3ef98f7361.pdf","source":"Annual report 2026"},{"point":"High returns on capital","quote":"Operating ROCE1 was 36.5% in FY26","page":127,"url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachHis/c3f6fa4a-3c51-453e-b634-3c3ef98f7361.pdf","source":"Annual report 2026"},{"point":"Loyal customer base driving revenue","quote":"Over 90% of Westside’s revenues are attributable to its loyal WSC members","page":118,"url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachHis/c3f6fa4a-3c51-453e-b634-3c3ef98f7361.pdf","source":"Annual report 2026"}],"bear":[{"point":"Like-for-like growth has slowed sharply","quote":"For the fashion portfolio the like for like growth during FY26 was in the low single digits","page":120,"url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachHis/c3f6fa4a-3c51-453e-b634-3c3ef98f7361.pdf","source":"Annual report 2026"},{"point":"Star grocery JV continues to lose money","quote":"THPL loss before exceptional items and tax in FY26 is ` 127.92 Crore as compared to ` 91.96 Crore in FY25","page":121,"url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachHis/c3f6fa4a-3c51-453e-b634-3c3ef98f7361.pdf","source":"Annual report 2026"},{"point":"Zara/Massimo Dutti stakes carry valuation risk due to Inditex control","quote":"it may be appropriate to take cognisance of the related uncertainties and risks involved in the valuation of the associated economics","page":126,"url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachHis/c3f6fa4a-3c51-453e-b634-3c3ef98f7361.pdf","source":"Annual report 2026"}],"watch":[{"point":"Whether new-store SPSF in Tier II/III markets matures as expected","quote":"the SPSF profile for our business continues to be influenced by our portfolio expansion choices and approach","page":120,"url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachHis/c3f6fa4a-3c51-453e-b634-3c3ef98f7361.pdf","source":"Annual report 2026"},{"point":"Whether Star's refit-driven traction translates into lower losses","quote":"in the second half of the year Star witnessed strong consumer traction, reflected in robust growth in footfalls","page":121,"url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachHis/c3f6fa4a-3c51-453e-b634-3c3ef98f7361.pdf","source":"Annual report 2026"}],"sources":["Annual report 2026"],"note":"This company does not hold earnings calls; read from its annual report instead.","as_of":"2026-11-15T18:55:20+05:30"}}